      "content": "i hear you on the hate speech and misinformation stuff, but it seems like a slippery slope. if we basically hand over the keys to the government to decide what's \"harmful,\" doesn't that just end the possibility of any real political dissent or independent journalism? isn't there a way to protect people without giving states total control over what we can see and say?",
